{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1788582537546342001,"compiled_state":{"alias":"written-peerless-kusimanse","assignee":null,"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":3,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"f9e61266576e2060f6a6a192145c12a62abe7b1082163764476985d14f1ea86d","event_uuid":"17db8366-5fed-4c8f-8c0d-701a2128b23b","position":{"commit_sha":"967d0e304fc1fad68b98a2d5a5afd9ab776d020d","position":"1788570339345325228-17db8366-5fed-4c8f-8c0d-701a2128b23b"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null},{"content_hash":"0e1cda847f3b1734eab22598c4f6c4a0715720cac98b59c5e4a32f3d12d7fce6","event_uuid":"1280e915-76d7-42ab-94e8-ae94f7937269","position":{"commit_sha":"1c5faf910c122bcada88722ad533bd60d8bcc1a2","position":"1788570349888457197-1280e915-76d7-42ab-94e8-ae94f7937269"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null},{"content_hash":"8274b642491608208980ae7fb6fffd757acfda1dd010bb96663b3f1eb5773e2f","event_uuid":"8a4bd6d5-7f15-4f2e-b455-8aad145819d2","position":{"commit_sha":"146a1039a40275ebdeb28f7dbb09b6cb59b18873","position":"1788573040666187609-8a4bd6d5-7f15-4f2e-b455-8aad145819d2"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1788570339345325228,"creation_channel":"mcp","deps":[],"description":"## Context / Problem\nTest assets outside `tests/unit/`, including interface, script, integration, external, and end-to-end suites. contains confirmed comment or docstring bloat from the audit pinned to `9e65567b79ffe872534c3c656ade7b34340d8192`. The file-specific constraints must survive consolidation.\n\n## Approach\nDelegate remediation to bounded directory/subsystem leaf cohorts. Each leaf edits only its declared paths, preserves the requirements recorded in its Scope, and supplies the authoritative file-impact set. This keeps responsibilities non-overlapping and each change reviewable in one session.\n\n## Scope\n- Direct container edits: none; repository edits belong to the leaf cohorts.\n- Delegated repository area: Test assets outside `tests/unit/`, including interface, script, integration, external, and end-to-end suites.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Every migrated path in this workstream appears in exactly one leaf Scope and matching file-impact record; verified by the migration inventory.\n- [ ] Each path's comments or docstrings retain its listed current constraints and consumer contract while removing redundant text; verified by the leaf's row-by-row completion comment.\n- [ ] Each leaf's declared verification commands exit 0 before that leaf closes.\n\n## Child decomposition\nEach directory/subsystem cohort owns all three criteria for its exact path set. Cohort path sets are disjoint; their union is this workstream's scope.","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"none","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["parent","3e32-a859-2153-4a1b"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"This workstream container makes no repository edits directly. Its leaf group tickets hold the exact paths; their commits and completion comments are the implementation evidence.","parent_id":"3e32-a859-2153-4a1b","parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":["rebar"],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["comments","documentation","maintainability","grouped-remediation"],"ticket_id":"2d43-3c39-307e-4450","ticket_type":"story","title":"Condense interface, integration, external, and end-to-end test comments","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["17db8366-5fed-4c8f-8c0d-701a2128b23b","1280e915-76d7-42ab-94e8-ae94f7937269","8a4bd6d5-7f15-4f2e-b455-8aad145819d2"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1788582537546342001,"uuid":"b02c44a8-779e-404b-8c1a-71ba465e197a"}